<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Carson Pirie EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Carson Pirie EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Lazzard Freres &amp; Co said Monday it raised its earnings per share estimates on retailer Carson Pirie Scott &amp; Co to $2.60 from $2.55 for 1997 and to $2.90 from $2.85 for 1998.</p>
<p>--Analyst Todd Slater cited the company's better-than-expected Q4 earnings and strong February comparable-store sales, which rose 8.2 percent over the same year-ago period. &quot;The current outlook is very strong,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>--Carson was up 5/8 at 27-7/8.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
